(text "LMR38020-Q1 5V/2A TI REV B REFERENCE: pinout GND1 EN2 VIN3 RT4 FB5 PG6 BOOT7 SW8 EP9. Provisional symbol/footprint. VIN needs external reverse and transient protection. FCH0650-150M uses PROVISIONAL existing Bourns footprint: pads must be reverified. NO VEHICLE RELEASE." (at 45 32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "66cb7200-c741-4ea6-8000-000000000169"))
(text "TripPower standalone: VIN_PROTECTED_UNFUSED is LM74930 common output, shared with an UNFUSED output pin; external branch cable fuse required; BUCK EN pin2 equals own VIN pin3. 5V_OUT pin is direct raw 2A output; no USB mux here. Do not fabricate: protection surge, thermals and FCH0650 provisional footprint unresolved." (at 45 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "66cb7200-c741-4ea6-8000-000000000170")) (text "U101 PG6 open-drain UNCONNECTED BY DESIGN (TI permits PG floating); no pullup. The MCU receives USB_ACTIVE_N from U301, not a VIN1 power-good guarantee. If PG is used later, add a safe pullup and handle no-VIN false-high condition." (at 26.67 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "66cb7200-c741-4ea6-8000-000000000900"))
